== Notes ==
* Isaac's {{i|The D6}} doesn't count as a "seen" special item, as it is directly given to him when the run starts.
* Special items given by the {{i|D4}}, the {{i|D100}}, 1-pip [[Dice Room]]s, and 6-pip {{r|Dice Room}}s count as "seen" special items.
* Due to the nature of special items, it can sometimes require hundreds of {{i|The D6}} rolls for special items that are not in the [[Item Pool#Treasure Room|Treasure Room pool]] to appear. (Note that with infinite rolls, it is always possible to see a special item as long as it is not already removed from the pools.)

